<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The Thane tractors, small and medium (D'thorga Farming, batch two; docs/development/farming-batch-two.md, "Tractors" and "Art"). Each
    size has two models under one Architect button (the owner's idea, 20 Nov 2026: the game's drop-down group), from the two pilot pictures
    the owner kept. A tractor carries an implement on its three-point linkage and pulls on its drawbar; with an implement that has a hitch
    of its own, a cart goes behind the implement (D'thorga Framework's lines of tows). It drives a paddock row by row with the implement
    working (the field run). Figures authored [A], labelled approximate, in the ranges of real farm tractors (general knowledge, not read
    from a source); the differences between the two models are the agent's reading of each picture, kept by the owner. No upgrade tree
    yet: its nodes wait for their drawn icons and overlays (the owner's next paid run, 20 Nov 2026). Part keys are saved by position:
    append only, never reorder. Not yet tested in game.
  -->

